<title>USA: Bay Village, Ohio won by Key Capital.</title>
<headline>Bay Village, Ohio won by Key Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Capital said it won $1.455 million of Bay Village, Ohio, general obligation various purpose bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.4939 percent.</p>
</text>
